{"parentUuid":"ad6d3f16-a0b4-4f5a-8eca-eede593ab1fc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a8a444ee54a52b4dc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BQH6H1z4NTDCsqgafFSw2R","type":"tool_result","content":"claude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:9:#   capture.sh doc <url>     freeze a doc page (e.g. https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks):\nclaude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:10:#                            its sha256 goes in the MANIFEST; its text only into a cache\nclaude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:35:# The first capture creates the MANIFEST, frozen at the installed version: it is\nclaude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:39:# seal DIR — SEAL lists the sha256 of every other file under DIR.\nclaude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:162:# capture_doc URL — freeze a doc page: fetch <url>.md, record its sha256 in the\nclaude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:174:  URL=\"$url\" V=\"$v\" SHA=\"$sha\" yq -i '.docs[strenv(URL)] = {\"version\": strenv(V), \"sha256\": strenv(SHA)}' \"$manifest\"\nclaude-mock/snapshots/capture.sh:175:  echo \"froze $url at sha256 $sha (text cached, not committed)\"\na10n\nbluwy-giget\nclaude\ngh\ngraphiti\nnode\nopencode\npkg\npuppeteer\nupdate-informer-rs","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0026dcd3-b3bc-4168-b6bc-c2fa407e87cb","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:45:17.566Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ad6d3f16-a0b4-4f5a-8eca-eede593ab1fc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a8a444ee54a52b4dc","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a5206b5b2ad4bea59"}
