{"parentUuid":"ac513420-34c7-42a4-8e98-0ece6a71ba8d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a8a444ee54a52b4dc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N46d4Cwr392HAL8wAjP2W1","type":"tool_result","content":"file-guard:\nadr-conformance\nadr-grounded\nadr-linked\nadr-matches-sloprails\nadr-well-formed\ncapability-covered\ncapability-grounded\ncapability-rigor\nchild-processes\nconcern-undeclared\nconfig-at-entry\nfile-size\ninvariant-covered\ninvariant-grounded\ninvariant-rigor\nlayering\nmodule-boundaries\nmodule-coverage\nmodule-distinct\nmodule-leaks\nmove-only\nshapes\nsnapshots-current\nstructure.yaml\n\nfile-guard/capability-rigor:\nfile-guard.yaml\ninputs-ready.sh\npairs-lib.sh\nprepare.sh\nsubjects.sh\ntests-prove-as-documented.md.j2\n# The mock's e2e tests match the real harness [judge]. For each harness\n# providing a capability, the tests marked `sr:proves <capability>/<harness>`\n# are compared with what the real harness actually did: the recorded runs the\n# capability cites (their normalized events, inlined) and its cited doc\n# sections. The tests must drive the mock into the recorded situation and\n# assert what the real harness produced (or a declared deviation). This is\n# the real-vs-mock comparison: the mock is proven by e2e tests, and the tests\n# are held to the recordings. One subject per capability touched (subjects.sh; its\n# (capability × harness) pairs are judged together), so a change to one capability\n# leaves another's verdict alone; prepare.sh builds the context of the subject it is handed.\nmatch: >-\n  path startsWith \"spec/capabilities/\" or path matches \"^[a-z0-9]+-mock/snapshots/\"\n  or any(markers, .kind == \"capability\" or .kind == \"provides\" or .kind == \"proves\")\n  or any(oldMarkers, .kind == \"capability\" or .kind == \"provides\" or .kind == \"proves\")\nsubjects: ./subjects.sh\nchecks:\n  - script: ./inputs-ready.sh   # its inputs exist, else no model call\n  - prepare: ./prepare.sh\n    judge: ./tests-prove-as-documented.md.j2\n    # the frozen doc pages live in a cache under the git dir, outside the project\n    allowed_tools: [Read]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f507ad55-62c2-42d7-8ac9-e650d0400986","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:46:04.087Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ac513420-34c7-42a4-8e98-0ece6a71ba8d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a8a444ee54a52b4dc","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a5206b5b2ad4bea59"}
