{"parentUuid":"34ee4a85-b82d-4fb8-8d15-e46cd058a708","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a8a444ee54a52b4dc","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffqNDYkEnY4MXJ7SjxtU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CguQ6ZpD7ahDe3UXxJcmMg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --base main --title \"claude: tests/recordings for foreground-subagent-result, background-agent, background-bash\" --body \"Pays the real gaps the capability-rigor judge found for three claude pairs.\n\nforeground-subagent-result/claude: tests pin the Agent tool_response fields against the recordings (nested and isolated sub-agents from meta, the SubagentStop block from hookmix, a kept worktree, toolStats, the hook order). New recordings (fgsub-report-scan, -perm, -role, -assistant, fgsub-tool-stats, fgsub-maxturns) showed behaviour the mock lacked, now modelled: subagent output scanning, usage and toolStats in the result, worktreeBranch, and a sub-agent stopping at its maxTurns. The API-error hand-back and SendMessage resume are declared modeled-surface.\n\nbackground-agent/claude: new recordings (bgagent-definition, bgagent-concurrent-limit, bgagent-nested-launcher) and tests for a definition with background: true kept in the background in -p mode, the concurrent sub-agent limit (default 20), a nested background agent reporting to the main conversation after its launcher ended (a mock bug: it was killed), and subagent_stats in the result frame. Agent teams, forks, permission prompts, the reduced tool set and the CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONCURRENT_SUBAGENTS setting are declared.\n\nbackground-bash/claude: a test for the stream frames of a background command that finishes on its own (midturn), and test_017_61 replays the recorded inputs instead of misreading the normalized events.\n\nCore pieces (scan, turn limit, tally, concurrent limit, stats, Registry.Adopt) are in internal/subagents and internal/tasks; the claude adapter only translates.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\" 2>&1 | tail -2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":461,"cache_read_input_tokens":507972,"output_tokens":745,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":461},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":745,"cache_read_input_tokens":507972,"cache_creation_input_tokens":461,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":461,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01CguQ6ZpD7ahDe3UXxJcmMg":{"command":"cd /Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a8a444ee54a52b4dc && gh pr create --base main --title \"claude: tests/recordings for foreground-subagent-result, background-agent, background-bash\" --body \"Pays the real gaps the capability-rigor judge found for three claude pairs.\n\nforeground-subagent-result/claude: tests pin the Agent tool_response fields against the recordings (nested and isolated sub-agents from meta, the SubagentStop block from hookmix, a kept worktree, toolStats, the hook order). New recordings (fgsub-report-scan, -perm, -role, -assistant, fgsub-tool-stats, fgsub-maxturns) showed behaviour the mock lacked, now modelled: subagent output scanning, usage and toolStats in the result, worktreeBranch, and a sub-agent stopping at its maxTurns. The API-error hand-back and SendMessage resume are declared modeled-surface.\n\nbackground-agent/claude: new recordings (bgagent-definition, bgagent-concurrent-limit, bgagent-nested-launcher) and tests for a definition with background: true kept in the background in -p mode, the co